{"id":"n58288-1-7","stage":2,"title":"배터리 · 电池","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58288-1-7-1","ko":"시계가 작동이 안 되는데요.","zh":"我的手表不能用了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시계가","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계가","audio":"/audio/5436ad1287684e9bc00a.mp3"}},{"text":"작동이","meaning":"运转，启动，发动","explanation":"작동：运转，启动，发动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"작동","audio":"/audio/470ae4e42a163c865fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73711","senseId":"1","lemma":"작동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작동이","audio":"/audio/5029b7797169ce623055.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"되는데요.","meaning":"运转、正常工作","explanation":"되다：顺利进行、正常运行；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되는데요","audio":"/audio/95bb747e05d2aa20a88c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]},{"id":"470ae4e42a163c86","term":"작동","zh":"运转，启动，发动","audio":"/audio/470ae4e42a163c865fae.mp3","entryId":"73711","definition":"机器等开动工作；或使机器等开动工作。","pronunciation":["작똥"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利进行、正常运行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"顺利进行、正常运行","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/83964935a2d324672bef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58288-1-7-2","ko":"배터리가 오래되어서 새로 바꾸셔야 해요.","zh":"电池已经用久了，需要换新的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배터리가","meaning":"电池","explanation":"배터리：电池；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배터리","audio":"/audio/5e29d5dcb84b45469293.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58288","senseId":"1","lemma":"배터리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배터리가","audio":"/audio/9e7a1ed05b4cbed005ee.mp3"}},{"text":"오래되어서","meaning":"久，老","explanation":"오래되다：久，老；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오래되다","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89515","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래되어서","audio":"/audio/8a561685b25f3c843cc0.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新。","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"바꾸셔야","meaning":"换，更换，调换","explanation":"바꾸다：换，更换，调换；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"1","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바꾸셔야","audio":"/audio/5c4e9642d99841117aa9.mp3"}},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e29d5dcb84b4546","term":"배터리"